From 540cb11cc136256829388dd2a7620f8577e3c846 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hustcui <1457310073@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2026 12:30:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add KIVI INT4 attention with residual cache management
 for Ascend NPU

- Generalize block copy ops to support KIVI's 6-component kv_cache layout
  (k_quant/k_scale/k_min + v_quant/v_scale/v_min)
- Add residual cache (full-precision window) for recent tokens
- Track per-request residual slots via req_ids
- Validate kivi_residual_length divisibility by kivi_group_size
